# AK_Nordic_Steel
# Cold, high-contrast and desaturated. Steel blues in the shadows with a hard midtone roll - reads as weight and consequence.
# Best for: Overcast days, battle and combat sequences, winter, dramatic beats.
# Apply AFTER a D-Log M -> Rec.709 conversion, not instead of one.
